===Behavior===
The Pinky Nursefather - Shiomi Yoru enters battle with 45 SP and 1 {{StatusEffect|Shin (心) - Dihui Star|b}}. Ryōshū will gain {{StatusEffect|Twisted and Disjointed Memory and Recollection|r}} for the fight.<br/>
The battle ends in a brief cutscene and scripted defeat when Shiomi Yoru loses all {{StatusEffect|Disjunction|b}} for the first time, or after Turn 11 ends.

====Attack Pattern====
Shiomi Yoru uses the following Skill Rotation for the first 4 turns of the Encounter:
* Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Swift Glimmer [快閃], Tripleslash [三連], Tripleslash [三連], Twinslash [二連]
* Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Tripleslash [三連], Tripleslash [三連], Twinslash [二連], Twinslash [二連]
* Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Swift Glimmer [快閃], Tripleslash [三連], Twinslash [二連]
* Rend Space [空間斬]

After finishing the above rotation, she will switch to the following one for the rest of the battle:
* Silent Regard, Swift Glimmer [快閃], Swift Glimmer [快閃],  Tripleslash [三連], Twinslash [二連]
* Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Formless Cut [無形斬], Tripleslash [三連], Twinslash [二連]
* Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Swift Glimmer [快閃], Tripleslash [三連]
* Rend Space [空間斬]

When Shiomi Yoru has at least 50 {{StatusEffect|Dihui Star's Blade (Araya)|b}}, all instances of Rend Space [空間斬] are replaced by Rend Space - String Connection [空間斬-緣]<br/>
Shiomi Yoru will always fix her Speed at 20 on the turn she uses Rend Space [空間斬], or 30 if using Rend Space - String Connection [空間斬-緣]

If at least 1 Sinner has less than 50% HP at the start of a turn during either Skill Rotation (excluding turns when Rend Space [空間斬] or Rend Space - String Connection [空間斬-緣] are being used), Shiomi Yoru gains another Skill Slot using Deathedge [絶命].

===Battle Tips===
''These are official tips that display in-game upon defeat in 9-33.''
* Examine the "Silent Regard" Skill—it provides a way to lower the enemy's Power for this turn.
* Examine the "Phantom Step [殘像步]" Skill—it may have a way to mitigate the enemy's unique debuff, "Bladetrail [Afterimage]."

