===Behavior===
Shiomi Yoru enters battle with 30 SP and 2 {{StatusEffect|Shin (心) - Dihui Star|b}}. Ryōshū will gain {{StatusEffect|Unsevered Memory|r}} for the duration of the fight. 

The battle will end in victory when Shiomi Yoru reaches 50% (959) HP.
====Attack Pattern====
Whenever {{StatusEffect|Disjunction|b}} is depleted, Shiomi Yoru will immediately end the turn and progress to the next stage of {{StatusEffect|Afterimage Entanglement|r}}.

While having {{StatusEffect|Fourfold Afterimage Entanglement|r}}, Shiomi Yoru uses the following skill rotation:
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Tripleslash [三連], Destinated Opponent, Twinslash [二連], Twinslash [二連]
*Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Tripleslash [三連], Destinated Opponent, Swift Glimmer [快閃], Destinated Opponent
*Silent Regard, You Have Failed to Stop the Future - Scartrail Slash [殘痕斬], Destinated Opponent, Twinslash [二連], Destinated Opponent, Destinated Opponent.

While having {{StatusEffect|Threefold Afterimage Entanglement|r}}, Shiomi Yoru switches to the following skill rotation:
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Destinated Opponent, Tripleslash [三連], Phantom Step [殘像步]
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Swift Glimmer [快閃], Formless Cut [無形斬], Tripleslash [三連], Destinated Opponent
*Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Destinated Opponent, Swift Glimmer [快閃], You Have Failed to Stop the Future - Scartrail Slash [殘痕斬], Destinated Opponent

While having {{StatusEffect|Twofold Afterimage Entanglement|r}}, Shiomi Yoru switches to the following skill rotation:
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Destinated Opponent,  Phantom Step [殘像步]
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Swift Glimmer [快閃], Formless Cut [無形斬], Destinated Opponent
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Destinated Opponent, You Have Failed to Stop the Future - Scartrail Slash [殘痕斬], Swift Glimmer [快閃]

While having {{StatusEffect|Onefold Afterimage Entanglement|r}}, Shiomi Yoru switches to the following skill rotation:
*Phantom Step [殘像步], Phantom Step [殘像步], Tripleslash [三連], Uttermost Rend Space - String Severance [空間斬 - 絕緣]
*Silent Regard, Silent Regard, Formless Cut [無形斬], Deathedge [絶命]
*Phantom Step, Formless Cut [無形斬], Swift Glimmer [快閃], Deathedge [絶命]

On turns where 'Destinated Opponent' is being used, Shiomi Yoru respectively inflicts {{StatusEffect|Dawn's First Crow (雞鳴)|r}}, {{StatusEffect|The Sun's Descent (日入)|r}}, and {{StatusEffect|Eventide Glow (黃昏)|r}} on random Sinners at the start of the turn, based on the number of 'Destinated Opponent' skills being used.

===Battle Tips===
''These are official tips that display in-game upon defeat in 9-41.''
* Check for Sinners that can Clash against 'Destinated Opponent' Skill with suitable Attack Skills, and build up damage on The Pinky Nursefather.
* Depending on the situation, it is important to plan impromptu and decide on which of The Pinky Nursefather's Skills should be Clashed first.

